SUMMARY:Door 9: Shine a light on shadow AI
DESCRIPTION:DO: Publish an approved-AI list with a fast request path - and 
 fix file over-sharing before AI assistants go live.\nDON’T: Ban everythi
 ng - blanket bans push people to tools you can’t see or govern.\n\nLesso
 n learnt (IBM Cost of a Data Breach\, Jul 2025): One in five organisations
  reported a breach involving shadow AI\; high levels of shadow AI added ab
 out US$670\,000 to breach costs.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design
 .github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=9&mode=advent\n\nAI-assisted · an initi
 ative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
