SUMMARY:Door 18: Urgency is not identity
DESCRIPTION:DO: Verify callers through a fixed process before any password\
 , MFA or account change.\nDON’T: Reset MFA because a caller sounds right
  - voices can be cloned and urgency can be faked.\n\nLesson learnt (Marks 
 & Spencer\, Apr 2025): Attackers got in through social engineering involvi
 ng a third party. M&S paused online orders for weeks and estimated a £300
  million hit to profit.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.i
 o/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=18&mode=advent\n\nAI-assisted · an initiative of
  ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
