SUMMARY:Door 21: Label the synthetic
DESCRIPTION:DO: Label AI-generated or manipulated images\, audio and video\
 , and keep a named human sign-off.\nDON’T: Publish synthetic media of re
 al people without consent - or let fakes of your leaders go unanswered.\n\
 nLesson learnt (WPP\, May 2024): Fraudsters used a voice clone and YouTube
  footage of WPP’s CEO in a fake video meeting to try to set up a new bus
 iness. Alert staff stopped it.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.g
 ithub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=21&mode=advent\n\nAI-assisted · an initia
 tive of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
