SUMMARY:Door 22: Know what you ship
DESCRIPTION:DO: Pin dependencies and CI actions to full commit SHAs\, keep 
 an SBOM\, and verify signatures.\nDON’T: Install a package an AI assista
 nt suggests without checking it’s real - or load untrusted model files.\
 n\nLesson learnt (tj-actions/changed-files\, Mar 2025): Attackers re-point
 ed the version tags of a popular GitHub Action to malicious code that dump
 ed CI secrets into build logs (CVE-2025-30066).\n\nOpen the door: https://
 aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=22&mode=advent\n\nAI-assi
 sted · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
